  "about": "\"I'm often consumed by the idea that today I am not yet what I could be tomorrow. I'm constantly chasing a concept of what I can be, never quite comfortable with being who I am in the present. I enjoy competing with future me!\"\n\nI'm interested in getting back into game and simulation development, and I'm open to collaboration on new projects. I focus on what I enjoy, creating experiences for the world to enjoy as well. I'm also open for C2C consulting and freelancing.\n\nFrom Software Development, Project Management, IT Infrastructure, Quality Assurance, and Cyber Security to Art, Web Design, and Video Game Development, my experiences are wide-ranging, and every day I continue to try to grow as fast as my creativity and the technology around me, while also not leaving my creative side behind. I am a knowledgeable professional able to provide value to any design, development or management team. I am a logical thinker who has shown versatility and ambition to learn as much as possible about software engineering and IT advancements. I am currently continuing my education to become a more valuable asset to my team and any innovative company.",
